; ── DRAFT 6 RIG (2026-10-09): the Iron Crow at 13 x 9 m. A dive lit by its
; fixtures — the bar pendants, the billiard lamp, the chalk-corner pendant,
; the booth sconce, three beer neons, the TV, the IRON CROW neon, the cooler,
; the jukebox — over a low warm key. Every omni sits under its fixture.
